*
* ESM 4: The TAB-delimited ASCII-file "ESM_4_Table_Offset.Dat" tabulates values of the Offset (= UTCI - Ta) in °C 
*        for different input values of:
*    Ta:	air temperature in°C (range: -50 °C to +50 °C)
*    Tr-Ta:	difference between mean radiant temperature (Tr) and air temperature in °C (-30 °C to +70 °C)
*    va:	wind speed in m/s measured 10 m above ground level (0.5 m/s to 30.3 m/s)
*    rH:	relative humidity in % (5% to 100%)
*    pa:	water vapour pressure in kPa (0 kPa to 5 kPa)
